  @section examples-io-index-xdmf Visualize a field with XDMF

  The XDMF format is recommended for visualization. It produces files
  compatible with [ParaView](https://www.paraview.org/):

  - @subpage examples-io-xdmf - Time-dependent vector field export

  @section examples-io-index-mesh Exchange mesh files

  Examples demonstrating mesh I/O and format conversion:

  - @subpage examples-io-mfem - Building a mesh programmatically and saving in MFEM format
  - @subpage examples-io-medit - Loading a MEDIT mesh and converting to MFEM format

  @section examples-io-index-see-also Further reading

  - @ref guides-io "I/O in Rodin" — Comprehensive I/O guide
